      "content": "it's not just about talking though. it's like... every day is just a cycle of her helping me and me feeling guilty about it. i see her getting tired, i see her losing her own life to take care of mine. i love her so much but i hate that i'm the reason she's so exhausted. sometimes i just think about how much easier things would be for her if she didn't have to worry about me anymore.",
